Setting Up DHCP
Source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=khw0I7_vY9A

Items:
    2911 Router
    2960 Switch
    Pc x2
    Server

Note: the Subnet Mask should automaitacllly set to 255.255.255.0

Connect the First Ethernet Cable to the Router and the swtich Gigabyte Connection.

The switch will the be connected to the server and computers

Set the Ip address of the Router and Server: 192.168.1.1 for the router. 

Set the Ip address of the Server to 192.168.1.2

Then turn on DHCP on the Sever

From there Access Each individual Computer and be sure it is set to accept DHCP ip addresses.
